d","slug":"alchemists-fire-moderate","splashDamage":{"value":2},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["alchemical","bomb","consumable","fire","infused","splash"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.8rEGphd48JD2zALZ"},{"_id":"TlTLpPCOdUagvCNY","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.97QyNEOAyYLdGaYc"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/alchemical-items/alchemical-bombs/bottled-lightning.webp","name":"Bottled Lightning (Moderate, Infused)","sort":600000,"system":{"baseItem":"alchemical-bomb","bonus":{"value":1},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"martial","containerId":null,"damage":{"damageType":"electricity","dice":2,"die":"d6"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Strike</p>\n<p>Bottled lightning is packed with volatile reagents that create a blast of electricity when they are exposed to air. Bottled lightning deals 2d6 electricity damage and 2 electricity splash damage. On a hit, the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} until the start of your next turn. You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"invested":null},"expend":1,"group":"bomb","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":3},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":10}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":2,"range":20,"reload":{"value":"-"},"rules":[{"key":"Note","selector":"{item|_id}-damage","text":"PF2E.BombNotes.BottledLightning.Moderate.success"}],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"size":"med","slug":"bottled-lightning-moderate","splashDamage":{"value":2},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["alchemical","bomb","consumable","electricity","infused","splash"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.TlTLpPCOdUagvCNY"},{"_id":"TUXQwzwuB2QRWdap","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.T6Appwwl6nUl56Xj"},"img":"icons/containers/bags/sack-simple-leather-tan.webp","name":"Tanglefoot Bag (Lesser, Infused)","sort":700000,"system":{"baseItem":"alchemical-bomb","bonus":{"value":0},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"martial","containerId":null,"damage":{"damageType":"bludgeoning","dice":0,"die":""},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A tanglefoot bag is filled with sticky substances. When you hit a creature with a tanglefoot bag, that creature takes a –10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 minute. The Escape DC is 17 ([[/act escape dc=17]]).</p>\n<p>On a critical hit, a creature in contact with a solid surface becomes stuck to the surface and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round, and a creature flying via wings has its wings tangled, causing it to fall safely to the ground and become unable to Fly again for 1 round. Tanglefoot bags are not effective when used on a creature that is in water.</p>\n<p>The target can end any effects by Escaping or spending a total of 3 actions to carefully remove the sticky substances. These Interact actions don't have to be consecutive, and other creatures can provide the actions as well.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"invested":null},"expend":1,"group":"bomb","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":3}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":2,"range":20,"reload":{"value":"-"},"rules":[{"key":"Note","outcome":["success"],"selector":"{item|_id}-attack","text":"PF2E.BombNotes.TanglefootBag.Lesser.success","title":"TYPES.Item.effect"},{"key":"Note","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"{item|_id}-attack","text":"PF2E.BombNotes.TanglefootBag.Lesser.criticalSuccess","title":"TYPES.Item.effect"}],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"size":"med","slug":"tanglefoot-bag-lesser","splashDamage":{"value":0},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["alchemical","bomb","consumable","infused"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.TUXQwzwuB2QRWdap"},{"_id":"KlYyHT4ccpQLK0J6","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.4tIVTg9wj56RrveA"},"img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-banded-simple-leather-brown.webp","name":"Leather Armor","sort":800000,"system":{"acBonus":1,"baseItem":"leather-armor","bulk":{"value":1},"category":"light","checkPenalty":-1,"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>A mix of flexible and molded boiled leather, a suit of this type of armor provides some protection with maximum flexibility.</p>"},"dexCap":4,"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"group":"leather","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":2}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"size":"med","slug":"leather-armor","speedPenalty":0,"strength":0,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"armor","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.KlYyHT4ccpQLK0J6"},{"_id":"Tuo6zitGS0xOw476","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.eurAnvH8bK0ZctOR"},"img":"icons/equipment/wrist/bracer-segmented-leather.webp","name":"Bracers of Missile Deflection","sort":900000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>These bracers are made from plates of durable dawnsilver and gleam like the summer sun.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A ranged weapon attack hits you but doesn't critically hit</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are aware of the attack and not off-guard</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The bracers send the missile off-course. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If this would cause the attack to be a failure, the attack misses you.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.PeiuJ951kkBPTCSM]{Effect: Bracers of Missile Deflection}</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","invested":null},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":3},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":52}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"bracers-of-missile-deflection","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["invested","magical"]},"usage":{"value":"wornbracers"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"equipment","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.Tuo6zitGS0xOw476"},{"_id":"DHbdQT264fOaCFxa","img":"icons/sundries/misc/key-short-gold.webp","name":"Key","sort":1000000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"containerId":null,"description":{"value":""},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"invested":null},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"equipment","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.DHbdQT264fOaCFxa"},{"_id":"oiHACGBUrWebvlA7","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.bDnk4TSzvD5BQmE5"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/consumables/potions/potion-of-fire-resistance.webp","name":"Potion of Fire Resistance (Lesser)","sort":1100000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"potion","containerId":null,"damage":null,"description":{"value":"<p>Drinking this thick, fortifying potion grants resistance 5 against fire damage for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Interact</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":6},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":45}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"potion-of-fire-resistance-lesser","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["consumable","magical","potion"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"uses":{"autoDestroy":true,"max":1,"value":1},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"consumable","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.oiHACGBUrWebvlA7"},{"_id":"iH1DW9SDoom5foXd","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.xE0EdDrf734l2fQH"},"img":"icons/consumables/potions/bottle-round-corked-green.webp","name":"Juggernaut Mutagen (Lesser)","sort":1200000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"mutagen","containerId":null,"damage":null,"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Interact</p>\n<hr />\n<p>After you drink this mutagen, your body becomes thick and sturdy. You exhibit a healthy glow, though you tend to be ponderous and unobservant.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain a +1 item bonus to Fortitude saves and 5 temporary Hit Points. Whenever you are at maximum Hit Points for at least 1 full minute, you regain the temporary Hit Points.</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> You take a -2 penalty to Will saves, Perception checks and initiative rolls.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 1 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.1l139A2Qik4lBHKO]{Effect: Juggernaut Mutagen (Lesser)}</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":4}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"juggernaut-mutagen-lesser","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["alchemical","consumable","elixir","mutagen","polymorph"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"uses":{"autoDestroy":true,"max":1,"value":1},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"consumable","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.iH1DW9SDoom5foXd"},{"_id":"fiVpkhoGCMxibpae","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.5ftFTiKY0BMvhzL9"},"img":"icons/consumables/potions/potion-bottle-corked-stopper-ornate-yellow.webp","name":"Stone Body Mutagen (Lesser)","sort":1300000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"mutagen","containerId":null,"damage":null,"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Interact</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This mutagen calcifies your body making it as hard as stone.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain resistance 5 to physical damage (except bludgeoning).</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> Your speeds are reduced by 10 feet (minimum 5 feet) and you take a -2 penalty to Reflex saves.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 10 minute.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.PEPOd38VfVzQMKG5]{Effect: Stone Body Mutagen (Lesser)}</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":22}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Adventure: The Fall of Plaguestone"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"stone-body-mutagen-lesser","traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","value":["alchemical","consumable","elixir","mutagen","polymorph"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"uses":{"autoDestroy":true,"max":1,"value":1},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"consumable","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.fiVpkhoGCMxibpae"},{"_id":"4W7aXiF7zzSQoKTr","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.TZUskLT7yvP7N2co"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/alchemical-items/alchemical-elixirs/elixir-of-life.webp","name":"Elixir of Life (Lesser, Infused)","sort":1400000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"elixir","containerId":null,"damage":{"formula":"3d6+6","kind":"healing","type":"untyped"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> Interact</p>\n<p>Elixirs of life accelerate a living creatures natural healing processes and immune system. Upon drinking this elixir, you regain @Damage[(3d6+6)[healing]] Hit Points and gain +1 item bonus to saving throws against diseases and poisons for 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.lPRuIRbu0rHBkoKY]{Effect: Elixir of Life}</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":5},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":30}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":3,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"elixir-of-life-lesser","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["alchemical","consumable","elixir","healing","infused"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"uses":{"autoDestroy":true,"max":1,"value":1},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"consumable","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!MrOq3FQgC4I8LuSS.4W7aXiF7zzSQoKTr"},{"_id":"L5avC32kdFcZp2IS","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.SLJTJwyIRjuWjfuK"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/alchemical-items/alchemical-elixirs/energy-mutagen.webp","name":"Acid Energy Mutagen (Moderate)","sort":1500000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"mutagen","containerId":null,"damage":null,"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (manipulate)</p><hr /><p>When created, this mutagen is attuned to one of four energy types: acid, cold, electricity, or fire. When consumed, the mutagen suffuses your body with energy that spills out whenever you attack. At higher levels, it can even grant you the ability to unleash the energy in controlled bursts.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit</strong> You gain resistance 10 to the attuned energy type. Whenever you score a hit with a melee weapon, add [[/r 1d4]] damage of the attuned energy type.</p>\n<p><strong>Drawback</strong> You gain weakness 5 to the other three energy types.</p>\n<p><strong>Duration</strong> 10 minutes.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.na2gf5mSkilFoHXk]{Effect: Energy Mutagen (Moderate)}</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn"},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":3},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"per":1,"value":{"gp":12}},"publication":{"license":"OR